      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I have been learning English for three years from my private academy teacher.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "He is Canadian and has been telling us a lot about Canada.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I would love to go there sometime in the future so that I can use all of the English I have learned.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "My dream vacation is to travel abroad to an English-speaking country.",
